scription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9548448620,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACOSHDbA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:visionos","name":"platform:visionos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-13T21:01:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T19:41:05Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T14:41:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123471","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123471","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123471.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123471.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-09T14:41:48Z"},"body":"# Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes two incorrect state changes and reduces the number of unnecessary Metal API calls, which result in a slight reduction in CPU usage.\r\n\r\n## Bug fixes\r\n\r\nTwo fixes to incorrect state:\r\n\r\n- A disabled depth bias was never written, so `setDepthBias` kept whatever the previous pipeline on the same encoder set. It is now written as zero.\r\n- A dynamic blend constant only applies to pipelines that declared `DYNAMIC_STATE_BLEND_CONSTANTS`. Previously `draw_list_set_blend_constants` also overrode the static color of a pipeline that did not.\r\n\r\n[depth_blend_regression_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32171298/depth_blend_regression_test.zip)\r\n\r\n| test | master | master result | PR | PR result |\r\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\r\n| blend constant leak | <img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" alt=\"blend_constant_leak_master\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd03bda4-dfeb-4938-b823-947a6084c0d8\" /> | 🔴 (white image) | <img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" alt=\"blend_constant_leak_pr\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/180ff7ae-6a39-45ac-9d55-ca748e26eb27\" /> | 🟢 (25% grey) |\r\n| depth bias leak | <img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" alt=\"depth_bias_leak_master\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa90dfdf-a5d6-4693-a253-7bbe50a04e24\" /> | 🔴 (red image) | <img width=\"128\" height=\"128\" alt=\"depth_bias_leak_pr\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/149ea0ee-0a82-4a28-ad77-418a74623a5b\" /> | 🟢 (green image) |\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Reduces warnings\r\n\r\nThese warnings are most often the result of redundant state changes on an existing encoder. They aren't a correctness issue; however, they do reduce unnecessary Objective-C calls which can improve CPU utilisation.\r\n\r\nRunning a project with the Metal debug layer enabled (`MTL_DEBUG_LAYER=1 MTL_DEBUG_LAYER_WARNING_MODE=nslog`) reports thousands of warnings per frame. They fall into three groups: redundant raster state, redundant argument buffer bindings, and bindings to stages that don't declare the resource. This PR removes the first two groups, and more than 50% of the third depending on the project and renderer.\r\n\r\nWarning lines reported by the debug layer over 300 frames on an M4 Max, with the per-frame count in parentheses:\r\n\r\n```\r\nMTL_DEBUG_LAYER=1 MTL_DEBUG_LAYER_ERROR_MODE=assert MTL_DEBUG_LAYER_WARNING_MODE=nslog godot --rendering-method <method> --quit-after 300\r\n```\r\n\r\n| Project | Method | 4.8 dev4 | This PR |\r\n| :-- | :-- | --: | --: |\r\n| Lights and Shadows | Forward+ | 128,920 (430) | 33,137 (110) |\r\n| Lights and Shadows | Mobile | 122,243 (407) | 45,121 (150) |\r\n| Bistro | Forward+ | 1,608,291 (5,361) | 64,562 (215) |\r\n| Bistro | Mobile | 1,083,528 (3,612) | 323,569 (1,079) |\r\n\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> I used 🤖 to run the tests and gather the statistics.\r\n\r\n\r\n### CPU time\r\n\r\nThe redundant calls were never expensive with the debug layer off, so I measured with a scene built to stress the driver: 6,000 individual draws per frame and ensure nearly every draw switches pipeline. 320x240 off-screen, vsync off, 30 seconds sampled after a 5 second warm-up, on an M4 Max.\r\n\r\n| | master | This PR |\r\n| :-- | --: | --: |\r\n| Frametime | 2.98 mspf | 2.87 mspf |\r\n| CPU time (render) | 1.38 mspf | 1.35 mspf |\r\n| GPU time | 2.46 mspf | 2.46 mspf |\r\n\r\nTime Profiler on the same scene puts the whole `render_draw_indexed` path at 1,038 µs per frame on master and 945 µs on this PR. Most of the saving is the fragment `setFragmentBytes` that is no longer issued when the fragment stage does not declare push constants (99 µs per frame), the rest is skipped raster state and argument buffer re-binds.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123471/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123471/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}